<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000002> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "information asset"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000002> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "data asset"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000002> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Actif constitué de contenu informationnel, comme un jeu de données, un ensemble de dossiers ou un document, indépendamment du support qui le porte."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000002> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An asset that is information content, such as a data set, a record collection or a document, independent of the medium that carries it."@en .
