<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000003> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "software asset"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000003> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "application"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000003> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Actif constitué d'un programme ou d'une application informatique, y compris sa configuration, considéré indépendamment du matériel qui l'exécute."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000003> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An asset that is a computer program or application, including its configuration, considered independently of the hardware that runs it."@en .
