<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000003> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285> "Software as instructions that prescribe machine behaviour (prescriptive ICE); CCO 2.2 core has no software class (review M)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000003> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "CyberRiskGuardian, plugins/cyberriskguardian/skills/cyber-risk-assessment/assets/scenario-template.json (commit f0cd36e)"@en .
