<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000011> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000853> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000011> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "asset valuation"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000011> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "évaluation d'actif"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000011> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "crown jewel record"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000011> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "joyau de la couronne"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000011> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A description of how much an entity matters to a given organisation, recording its criticality, its confidentiality, integrity and availability requirements, its owner and whether it is a crown jewel."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000011> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Description de l'importance d'une entité pour une organisation donnée, qui consigne sa criticité, ses exigences de confidentialité, d'intégrité et de disponibilité, son propriétaire et son statut de joyau de la couronne."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000011> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000011> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000064> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000011> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285> "Carries the context-dependent part of 'asset' so Asset can stay rigid (decision Q3); maps CRG CROWN."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000011> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "CyberRiskGuardian, examples/medibec/source/data30.json and budget.json (commit f0cd36e)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000011> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "Phase 1 report (8 Oct 2026), section 5 and recorded decisions"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000011> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000288> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000181> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000011> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000289> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000182> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000011> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000290> "2026-10-08"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000011> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000291> "0.1.0" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000012
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000012> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000012> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000023> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000012> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "rôle de source de menace"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000012> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "threat source role"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000012> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "source de menace"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000012> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "threat actor"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000012> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A role borne by an agent or artifact in virtue of which it may initiate a threat event, intentionally or not."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000012> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Rôle porté par un agent ou un artefact en vertu duquel il peut déclencher un événement de menace, intentionnellement ou non."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000012> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000012> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000064> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000012> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285> "Role keeps people and organisations rigid; environmental sources are described with ThreatSourceDescription (review M)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000012> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "ISO/IEC 27005:2022, risk concepts (paraphrased; clause numbers to verify against the licensed text)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000012> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "MOACCO 1.2a (retired), Herzog et al. Security.owl concepts Threat, Vulnerability, Countermeasure"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000012> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "NIST SP 800-30 Rev. 1 (2012), Appendices D-I (threat sources, events, vulnerabilities and predisposing conditions, likelihood, impact, risk)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000012> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000288> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000181> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000012> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000289> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000182> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000012> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000290> "2026-10-08"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000012> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000291> "0.1.0" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000014
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000014> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000014> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000853> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000014> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "description d'événement de menace"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000014> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "threat event description"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000014> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "threat event type"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000014> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A description of a kind of event that, if it occurred, could adversely affect assets, such as credential phishing, ransomware encryption or a server-room fire."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000014> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Description d'un type d'événement qui, s'il se produisait, pourrait porter atteinte à des actifs, comme l'hameçonnage d'identifiants, le chiffrement par rançongiciel ou l'incendie d'une salle des serveurs."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000014> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000014> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000064> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000014> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285> "Possible events are described, not instantiated (Phase 1 section 5.3); linked to ATT&CK by mapping."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000014> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "NIST SP 800-30 Rev. 1 (2012), Appendices D-I (threat sources, events, vulnerabilities and predisposing conditions, likelihood, impact, risk)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000014> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "Phase 1 report (8 Oct 2026), section 5 and recorded decisions"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000014> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000288> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000181> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000014> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000289> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000182> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000014> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000290> "2026-10-08"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000014> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000291> "0.1.0" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000015
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000015> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000015> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000015> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "incident"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000015> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "incident"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000015> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "incident de confidentialité"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000015> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An actual occurrence of an adverse event affecting the organisation's assets or information, including a confidentiality incident under Loi 25."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000015> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Occurrence réelle d'un événement défavorable touchant les actifs ou l'information de l'organisation, y compris un incident de confidentialité au sens de la Loi 25."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000015> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000015> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000063> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000015> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285> "Needed for the Loi 25 incident register and history."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000015> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "ISO/IEC 27005:2022, risk concepts (paraphrased; clause numbers to verify against the licensed text)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000015> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "Loi 25 (L.Q. 2021, c. 25); CAI guidance on confidentiality incidents"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000015> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000288> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000181> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000015> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000289> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000182> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000015> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000290> "2026-10-08"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000015> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000291> "0.1.0" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000016
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000016> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000016> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000548> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000016> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "vulnerability"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000016> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "vulnérabilité"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000016> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "faiblesse"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000016> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "faille"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000016> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "weakness"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000016> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A disposition of a material asset, such as a device, storage medium or network equipment, or of an organisation, that a threat source can exploit to cause harm. Weaknesses of software, information or controls are recorded as vulnerability descriptions."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000016> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Disposition d'un actif matériel, comme un appareil, un support de stockage ou un équipement réseau, ou d'une organisation, qu'une source de menace peut exploiter pour causer un préjudice. Les faiblesses des logiciels, de l'information ou des contrôles sont consignées comme descriptions de vulnérabilité."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000016> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000016> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000063> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000016> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285> "Aligned to CCO Vulnerability; restricted to material bearers after HermiT finding and review H6."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000016> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "Common Core Ontologies 2.2 (2026-08-13), alignment target"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000016> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "ISO/IEC 27005:2022, risk concepts (paraphrased; clause numbers to verify against the licensed text)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000016> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "MOACCO 1.2a (retired), Herzog et al. Security.owl concepts Threat, Vulnerability, Countermeasure"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000016> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "NIST SP 800-30 Rev. 1 (2012), Appendices D-I (threat sources, events, vulnerabilities and predisposing conditions, likelihood, impact, risk)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000016> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000288> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000181> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000016> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000289> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000182> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000016> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000290> "2026-10-08"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000016> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000291> "0.1.0" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000017
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000017> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000017> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000016> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000017> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "condition prédisposante"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000017> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "predisposing condition"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000017> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A condition of the organisation, its environment or its systems that increases or decreases the likelihood that a threat event causes harm, without being a weakness of a specific control."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000017> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Condition de l'organisation, de son environnement ou de ses systèmes qui augmente ou diminue la probabilité qu'un événement de menace cause un préjudice, sans être une faiblesse d'un contrôle précis."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000017> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000017> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000064> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000017> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285> "SP 800-30 Appendix F; examples: single telecom link, ground-floor server room."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000017> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "NIST SP 800-30 Rev. 1 (2012), Appendices D-I (threat sources, events, vulnerabilities and predisposing conditions, likelihood, impact, risk)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000017> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "Phase 1 scenario extraction (Drive folder 'scenarios'): corpora A-D, F"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000017> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000288> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000181> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000017> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000289> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000182> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000017> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000290> "2026-10-08"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000017> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000291> "0.1.0" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000018
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000018> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000018> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000853> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000018> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "constat de lacune de contrôle"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000018> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "control gap finding"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000018> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "contrôle manquant"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000018> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "missing control"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000018> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A description stating that an expected control is absent or inadequate in an organisation, such as no penetration testing or no continuity plan."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000018> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Description qui constate l'absence ou l'insuffisance d'un contrôle attendu dans une organisation, comme l'absence de tests d'intrusion ou de plan de continuité."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000018> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
