<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000018> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285> "Phase 1 gap 4; an absence cannot be a disposition, so modelled as a finding (review H2)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000018> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "Phase 1 report (8 Oct 2026), section 5 and recorded decisions"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000018> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "Phase 1 scenario extraction (Drive folder 'scenarios'): corpora A-D, F"@en .
