# 
# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000019
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000019> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000019> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000965> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000019> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "control"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000019> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "mesure de sécurité"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000019> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "contrôle"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000019> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "countermeasure"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000019> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "safeguard"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000019> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A prescription of a measure that modifies risk, such as a policy, procedure, technical safeguard or practice, independent of whether any organisation has implemented it."@en .
